    "Rewrite spatial wording into non-spatial engine equivalents: pillar-in-the-current delays foe's next ready art by 0.5 s on the next 3 hits before exiting stance; The Harvest Bell targets self only in 1v1; He Waited maps Still/no-move to own.composed and decays 1 wait_ward/pulse when un-Composed; Pillar in the Flood uses delay_immune + unmoved while >50% HP in one mod dict.",
