    "Assign rarity 4 to the 3 grade-3 unique treasures (cl-old-locust-seal, cl-keystone-toll-seal, cl-first-sheaf-bell) and apply the R6 common-art/ward exception to all 12 items with common-art bases (leaving arts [] and omitting exception on kinh/nhan/ngoc_boi items).",
